  "name": "Embedded 2017 UA Server Profile",
  "uri": "http://opcfoundation.org/UA-Profile/Server/EmbeddedUA2017",
  "description": "This Profile is a FullFeatured Profile that is intended for devices with more than 50 MBs of memory and a more powerful processor. This Profile builds upon the Micro Embedded Device Server Profile. The most important additions are: support for security via the Security Policies and support for the Standard DataChange Subscription Server Facet. This Profile also requires that Servers expose all OPC-UA types that are used by the Server including their components and their super-types.<br>\nThis Profile supersedes the <a href=\"http://opcfoundation.org/UA-Profile/Server/EmbeddedUA\">Embedded UA Server Profile</a> and requires support of a security policy."
 },
